# Lucian: The Lantern - Vietnamese (a stage: the HUD, Lucian, enemies, bosses, tips, scenes, the end card).
# Each msgid is the English text as the code or the data has it; Lang.t()
# looks it up. A msgstr keeps its msgid's values (%d, %s, {name}) in the
# same order, and its BBCode tags. docs/translation.md has the rules.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: vi\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"

#. Endless: the result card's title
msgid "RUN OVER"
msgstr "KẾT THÚC LƯỢT"

#. Endless: the result's green line when the run beat its best; %d is the waves cleared
msgid "New best: %d waves!"
msgstr "Kỷ lục mới: %d đợt!"

#. Endless: the result's green line when the run beat its best; %d is the waves cleared
msgid "New best: %d wave!"
msgstr "Kỷ lục mới: %d đợt!"

#. Endless: the result's Modifier row with none in effect, and the card that clears the modifier (both lines)
msgid "None"
msgstr "Không có"

#. Endless: the result's Modifier row with none in effect, and the card that clears the modifier (both lines)
msgid "Nothing"
msgstr "Không có"

#. Endless: milestone banner and result line; the values are the wave, the blue and the orange essence won
msgid "Wave %d won for the first time: +%d blue and +%d orange essence"
msgstr "Lần đầu vượt qua đợt %d: +%d tinh chất xanh và +%d tinh chất cam"

#. Result card: row names of the stats column (their values come next to them)
